      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've waited > 12 hours since my first discovery of this bug, and yes they're still showing up.\n\n```\n\n2026.04.11 19:39:32 Error      -  [API] [3259, 404, Get, -1 https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/avatars/avtr_0c344df6-2b19-4d6b-9276-baee5938bebf] Abandoning request, because - Avatar Not Found\n\n2026.04.11 19:39:32 Error      -  [API] [3260, 404, Get, -1 https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/avatars/avtr_0c344df6-2b19-4d6b-9276-baee5938bebf] Abandoning request, because - Avatar Not Found\n\n2026.04.11 19:39:32 Error      -  [API] [3261, 404, Get, -1 https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/listing/prod_bfe7407d-40b2-407c-bc6f-53a04aa39e1e?hydrateProducts=true] Abandoning request, because - That listing doesn't exist․ It may have been removed․\n\n```",
