      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had this issue too and it sometimes still reoccurs.\n\nWhat I found helped remove the listings appearing on the store after setting them back to draft was playing with tags? Don't ask how or why, but changing the tags stopped my avatars appearing on the store. \n\nCould have just been a fluke though.\n\nAt least it looked that way to me when I was doing some testing with a customer.",
